**\n   - If the platform allows account switching (e.g., Google, Microsoft), select your standard account from the list of remembered accounts.\n\n### For Local Computer Accounts:\n- **Windows:**\n  1. Press `Ctrl + Alt + Delete` and select \"Switch User.\"\n  2. Choose your standard account from the list of users.\n  3. Enter your password to log in.\n\n- **MacOS:**\n  1. Click on the Apple menu and select \"Log Out.\"\n  2. Log in with your standard user account from the login screen.\n\n### For Social Media Apps (e.g., Instagram, Facebook):\n1. Go to the account menu in the app.\n2. If you've linked multiple accounts, tap on your standard account to switch back.\n3. If not linked, log out and log in again using your standard account credentials.\n\nIf you’re referring to a specific service or platform and need tailored instructions, let me know!"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"sonic_classification_result":{"latency_ms":2131549274.994249,"search_prob":0},"citations":[],"content_references":[],"message_type":null,"model_slug":"gpt-4o","default_model_slug":"gpt-4o","parent_id":"2fdd1900-b4e9-4f1b-b403-1399951d6dc6","request_id":"8eaa2aef1928f849-ORD","timestamp_":"absolute","model_switcher_deny":[{"slug":"o3","context":"regenerate","reason":"unsupported_audio","is_available":false,"description":"This model doesn't support audio."},{"slug":"o3","context":"conversation","reason":"unsupported_audio","is_available":false,"description":"This model doesn't support audio."},{"slug":"o4-mini","context":"regenerate","reason":"unsupported_audio","is_available":false,"description":"This model doesn't support audio."},{"slug":"o4-mini","context":"conversation","reason":"unsupported_audio","is_available":false,"description":"This model doesn't support audio."},{"slug":"o4-mini-high","context":"regenerate","reason":"unsupported_audio","is_available":false,"descri